# Normalise line endings in the repository; check out native.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary, rather than relying on the sniffing `text=auto` does. A
# screenshot that got line-ending normalisation applied to it is a corrupt file,
# and the place it would show up is the landing page.
*.png        binary
*.jpg        binary
*.pdf        binary

# Keep GitHub's language stats about the code. Without this the repo reads as
# "Markdown" — docs/Codebase.md, docs/Usage.md and the plan/spec archive under
# docs/superpowers/ together outweigh every .py file.
*.md         linguist-documentation
docs/**      linguist-documentation
